{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to explore and craft in Cauldron Craft!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/7e9bdd14dcf7d3a0dbc01b6f062e17ea.avif?t=1762501017\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >105+ magical and unique items to discover and craft.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tome beckons. Inspect items at the Tome to discover item traits. Transfer traits during crafting to create the ultimate item...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mastery over items as you practice your craft. Equip stronger tools, level up and collect higher and higher quality items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/312c40a189184b12ad1ec3841f005de6.avif?t=1762501017\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and unlock 3 different areas, each with a day and night cycle. Travel at the right time to find certain items. You can't find everything in the morning!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the days slip by. Complete quests, trade items for rewards and unearth the secrets of Cauldron Craft.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/f3a0923e90aa8f53f8a47e32909a2a76.avif?t=1762501017\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game develops, I'm hoping to add 3 new areas for the mid-game story and finalize it with 3 more areas for the end game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the explorable areas triple, I'm anticipating the number of items to triple, bringing us to a total of 300+ items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day and night cycle is the first step for the varied exploration system. I want to bring a weather system to complement the day and night to keep things interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001700?t=1762501017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/cb04f0b7637ab0adb0a81ef347347b2a72c5b1e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762501017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/b714b885b71d9c01d9c9224e66b408c9fd0cb630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762501017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/b714b885b71d9c01d9c9224e66b408c9fd0cb630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762501017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to explore and craft in Cauldron Craft!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/7e9bdd14dcf7d3a0dbc01b6f062e17ea.avif?t=1762501017\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >105+ magical and unique items to discover and craft.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tome beckons. Inspect items at the Tome to discover item traits. Transfer traits during crafting to create the ultimate item...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mastery over items as you practice your craft. Equip stronger tools, level up and collect higher and higher quality items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/312c40a189184b12ad1ec3841f005de6.avif?t=1762501017\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and unlock 3 different areas, each with a day and night cycle. Travel at the right time to find certain items. You can't find everything in the morning!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the days slip by. Complete quests, trade items for rewards and unearth the secrets of Cauldron Craft.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/f3a0923e90aa8f53f8a47e32909a2a76.avif?t=1762501017\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game develops, I'm hoping to add 3 new areas for the mid-game story and finalize it with 3 more areas for the end game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the explorable areas triple, I'm anticipating the number of items to triple, bringing us to a total of 300+ items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day and night cycle is the first step for the varied exploration system. I want to bring a weather system to complement the day and night to keep things interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ByePidgeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/ebfa2b85784083c0e05bd17d89387b56e60331c0/header.jpg?t=1762501017","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></l